content:
This week in New York, I’ll be meeting leaders from across the globe.

On Sunday, together with António Costa and Kaja Kallas, we met with:

@unitednations Secretary-General, @antonioguterres, to reaffirm our unwavering support for his efforts to reform and revitalise the UN system;

And the @africanunion_official Commission Chairperson, Mahamoud Ali Youssouf.

Europe and Africa are natural partners, and we’re preparing for an important Summit in Angola this November.

